print_FRU

3F  88   6	***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***
		DRIVE FAILED BECAUSE OF A DEFERED ERROR REPORTED BY THE DRIVE
		This condition requires that the drive be replaced as soon as
		possible.  User data is still available by using parity, but
		a second failure at this time (when a drive has been downed)
