print_FRU

3F  89   6	***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***
		DRIVE FAILED BY START OF DAY APPLICATION CODE BECAUSE OF A
		DRIVE REPLACEMENT ERROR
		This condition requires that the drive be replaced as soon as
		possible.  User data is still available by using parity, but
		a second failure at this time (when a drive has been downed)
		will result in the loss of data for the entire Lun (Raid 5)
		or will result in an unrecoverable error (other raid levels).
print_FRU

3F  90   6	***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***
		UNRECOVERED READ/WRITE ERROR
		Unrecovered read errors always will cause this condition to
		be generated.  Unrecovered write errors will cause this if
		the state of the LUN or the RAID level guarantees that data
		at other addresses will not be affected by the failed oper-
		ation and continued access to this drive.
		A second drive failure or warning condition on another
		drive may prevent reconstruction of this drive.
		***********************************************************
print_FRU

3F  91   6	***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***  WARNING  ***
		DRIVE REPORTED DEFERRED ERROR CAUSED DRIVE TO BE PLACED IN
		WARNING
		***********************************************************
print_FRU

