3F  E0   6	****  CRITICAL ARRAY ERROR  ****  CRITICAL ARRAY ERROR  ****
		LUN DOWNED - COMMAND CANNOT EXECUTE BECAUSE THE LUN HAS BEEN
		DOWNED
		Subsequent media access commands to this LUN will not execute,
		but will return sense information as to the cause.
		  ASC     ASCQ          Meaning
		  84      01            Multiple drives have been downed
		  84      02            Mode parameters for drives don't match
		  84      03            Drive channel verification failed
		  84      04            SCSI ID verification failed
		  84      05            Format in progress
		  84      06            Awaiting format
		  84      08            Wrong drive was replaced
		  84      09            Component failure on multiple channels
		Attempt a backup of the array.  Replace the failed drives,
		reformat, and restore data from the last successful backup
		copy. 
		**************************************************************
print_FRU
 
